      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{62df1f0a67455d44a15a629a|full_name} i added a fire contact receiver to light my avatar on fire and people enjoy it. I had to make my own lighter (which is just a cube with a lighter PNG lol) because I can't buy the actual lighter item VRC released. Funny is I also have to ask people if they have the campfire because I don't have it and can't get it. I've been a huge believer that any VRC+ items should become available regardless if you missed their initial release so everyone can have it. Because they leaned into FOMO so hard with items is exactly why I don't and won't buy any til they do away with it. To thunk, I'd have paid for that lighter but I didn't get the idea for lighting my avatar on fire until after it was available and I missed my chance. That's a huge bummer. They want money so bad and yet they make it harder to get items and wonder where the problem is. Let me buy items that aren't available! I want the lighter! Make all VRC+ gifted items available to anyone who gets VRC+ I pay for VRC+ and want everyone to have the items. I don't need to be \"cool\" for having them when others don't. I wanna share fun experiences! This gatekeeping FOMO crap is so exhausting.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
